"`HTTPS_PROXY` environment variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_EnvHttpProxyAgent.md:25
msgid ""
"**noProxy** `string` (optional) - When set, it will override the "
"`NO_PROXY` environment variable."
msgstr ""

